<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vitro raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vitro raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell analysts Shayne McGuire and Leonardo Simpser raised their rating on Mexico's Vitro SA Tuesday to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The stock has outperformed the Mexican stock market by five percent since April 7, they said.</p>
<p>-- The company's American Depositary Receipts were up 1/8 to 8-3/8.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1879))</p>
